#. module: bf_training
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training/models/training_assignment.py:0
msgid ""
"%(nom)s has no email address: the reminder cannot go out. Add their address,"
" then send the reminder again."
msgstr ""
"%(nom)s n'a pas d'adresse courriel : la relance ne peut pas partir. Ajoutez "
"son adresse, puis relancez."

#. module: bf_training
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training.view_training_record_form
msgid ""
".\n"
"                        The line stays in the register and drops out of the totals: what\n"
"                        is missing is not worth zero."
msgstr ""
".\n"
"                        La ligne reste au registre, et elle sort des totaux : ce qui\n"
"                        manque ne vaut pas zéro."

#. module: bf_training
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training.view_training_record_form_mine
msgid ""
".\n"
"                        The register officer completes the line once they have the information."
msgstr ""
".\n"
"                        L'agent du registre complète la ligne quand il a l'information."

#. module: bf_training
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training.field_bf_training_activity__validity_months
msgid ""
"0 means the training never expires. Otherwise a completion's expiry date is "
"computed from the date it was completed."
msgstr ""
"0 signifie que la formation ne périme pas. Sinon, la date d'expiration d'une"
" réalisation se calcule depuis sa date de réalisation."

#. module: bf_training
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training.field_bf_training_requirement__renewal_months
msgid "0 takes the activity's validity. Otherwise this value wins."
msgstr "0 prend la validité de l'activité. Sinon, cette valeur prime."

#. module: bf_training
#: model:mail.template,body_html:bf_training.mail_template_training_reminder
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n"
"                    <p>Hello <t t-out=\"object.employee_id.name or object.partner_id.name or ''\">First name</t>,</p>\n"
"                    <p>The training <strong t-out=\"object.activity_id.name\">Activity</strong>\n"
"                        is due\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.due_date\">on\n"
"                            <!-- &#128308; The date is formatted in the person's own language:\n"
"                                 `t-out` on a raw date rendered &#171; 2026-09-16 &#187;. -->\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.due_date, date_format='d MMMM yyyy', lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)\">16 September 2026</strong></t>.</p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object.activity_id.duration_hours\">\n"
"                        <!-- &#171; 2.0 hours &#187; becomes &#171; 2 hours &#187;. &#9888;&#65039; No decimal comma here,\n"
"                             unlike the French body: English writes &#171; 1.5 hours &#187;. -->\n"
"                        Planned duration:\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"'%g' % object.activity_id.duration_hours\">2</t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.activity_id.duration_hours &lt;= 1\">hour</t><t t-else=\"\">hours</t>.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <!-- &#128308; The reminder carried NO link at all: people knew they owed\n"
"                         training and had no way to get to it. -->\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object.training_url\" style=\"margin: 24px 0;\">\n"
"                        <!-- &#9888;&#65039; The button colour comes from the COMPANY, never from a code\n"
"                             written here: this module ships to other organisations. It\n"
"                             follows the chosen layout (brand accent under the in-house\n"
"                             layout, email button colour under Odoo's): see\n"
"                             `_compute_reminder_presentation`. -->\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"object.training_url\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: {{ object.reminder_button_color }}; padding: 10px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n"
"                            Open the training\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <!-- No name when the layout already adds the company signature. -->\n"
"                    <p>Thank you,<t t-if=\"object.reminder_signature_name\"><br/><t t-out=\"object.reminder_signature_name\">The company</t></t></p>\n"
"                </div>"
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n"
"                    <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.employee_id.name or object.partner_id.name or ''\">Prénom</t>,</p>\n"
"                    <p>La formation <strong t-out=\"object.activity_id.name\">Activité</strong>\n"
"                        est attendue\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.due_date\">pour le\n"
"                            <!-- &#128308; La date se formate dans la langue de la personne :\n"
"                                 `t-out` sur une date brute rendait &#171; 2026-09-16 &#187;. -->\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.due_date, date_format='d MMMM yyyy', lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)\">16 septembre 2026</strong></t>.</p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object.activity_id.duration_hours\">\n"
"                        <!-- &#171; 2.0 heures &#187; devient &#171; 2 heures &#187;, &#171; 1.5 &#187; devient &#171; 1,5 &#187;. -->\n"
"                        Durée prévue :\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"('%g' % object.activity_id.duration_hours).replace('.', ',')\">2</t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.activity_id.duration_hours &lt;= 1\">heure</t><t t-else=\"\">heures</t>.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <!-- &#128308; La relance n'avait AUCUN lien : la personne savait qu'elle\n"
"                         devait une formation et n'avait aucun moyen d'y aller. -->\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object.training_url\" style=\"margin: 24px 0;\">\n"
"                        <!-- &#9888;&#65039; La couleur du bouton vient de la SOCI&#201;T&#201;, jamais d'un code\n"
"                             &#233;crit ici : ce module part chez d'autres organisations. Elle\n"
"                             suit la mise en page retenue (accent de marque sous la mise en\n"
"                             page maison, couleur des boutons de courriel sous celle\n"
"                             d'Odoo) : voir `_compute_reminder_presentation`. -->\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"object.training_url\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: {{ object.reminder_button_color }}; padding: 10px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n"
"                            Ouvrir la formation\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <!-- Pas de nom quand la mise en page pose d&#233;j&#224; la signature de la soci&#233;t&#233;. -->\n"
"                    <p>Merci,<t t-if=\"object.reminder_signature_name\"><br/><t t-out=\"object.reminder_signature_name\">La société</t></t></p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

#. module: bf_training
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_training.action_training_category
msgid ""
"A category is mostly there for quotas: \"six hours a year, three\n"
"               of them on this subject, and first aid does not count\" cannot be\n"
"               said without them."
msgstr ""
"Une catégorie sert surtout aux quotas : « six heures par an, dont\n"
"               trois sur tel sujet, et le secourisme ne compte pas » ne se dit\n"
"               pas sans elles."

#. module: bf_training
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training.view_training_record_form
msgid ""
"A certificate received from outside is filed here. It is\n"
"                                kept for six years after the last year it relates\n"
"                                to."
msgstr ""
"L'attestation reçue de l'extérieur se range ici. Elle se\n"
"                                conserve six ans après la dernière année à laquelle elle\n"
"                                se rapporte."

#. module: bf_training
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training.field_bf_training_activity__reopen_on_change
msgid ""
"A completion obtained on an earlier version no longer covers the "
"requirement. Without this, everybody trained on the old version keeps "
"showing as up to date on the new one."
msgstr ""
"Une réalisation obtenue sur une version antérieure ne couvre plus "
"l'exigence. Sans cela, tout l'effectif formé sur l'ancienne version reste "
"affiché à jour sur la nouvelle."

