#. module: bf_training
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training/models/training_requirement.py:0
msgid "A requirement about one specific activity must name that activity."
msgstr ""
"Une exigence portant sur une activité précise doit nommer cette activité."

#. module: bf_training
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training/models/training_requirement.py:0
msgid ""
"A requirement in hours must say how many hours. Zero hours is not a "
"requirement."
msgstr ""
"Une exigence en heures doit dire combien d'heures. Zéro heure n'est pas une "
"exigence."

#. module: bf_training
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_training.action_training_requirement
msgid ""
"A requirement says who owes what, by when, and on what regulatory\n"
